-- (uploads/evidence/EV-DEMO-*.pdf). On Render's ephemeral filesystem these
-- files will NOT exist after a redeploy/restart, so evidence download
-- links for demo transactions may 404 - this is a known limitation of
-- free-tier ephemeral storage (see README), not a data or logic error.
